OL,3,GNEWSAM60 remains partially closed after
OL,4,Alorry crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M60 remains partially closed after
OL,7,Fa lorry crashed through the central
OL,8,Freservation barriers, causing a large
OL,9,Ffuel spill.
OL,11,FNational Highways said the motorway was
OL,12,Fstill shut clockwise between junction
OL,13,F13 for Worsley and junction 15 for the
OL,14,FM61 while the fuel was cleared.
OL,16,FThe anticlockwise M60 has partially
OL,17,Freopened, but lane three remains closed
OL,18,Fbetween junctions 15 and 14 because of
OL,19,Fdamage to the barriers.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
